              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Abuneeri n'abashaija makumi abiri baashanga Daudi Heburooni. Daudi yaateekyera Abuneeri obugyenyi n'abashaija abu yaabaire aine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abuneeri yaagira Daudi ati: Niinyija kwimuka, nteeranire Abaisraeli boona ahari mukama wangye omu gabe, baragaane naiwe endagaano, obone kutegyeka abu omutima gwawe gurikwenda boona. Atyo Daudi yaayohereza Abuneeri; yaagyenda n'obusingye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago maguru abagaragwa ba Daudi na Yoabu, abaabaire bahurwire, baatabaaruka n'eminyago mingi; kwonka baashanga Abuneeri atakiri na Daudi, ahakuba akaba yaamwohereize, yayengyendeire n'obusingye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu ku yaahikire aho, naatabaaruka n'engabo ze zoona ezi yaabaire aine, baamugira bati: Abuneeri mwene Neeri aizire ow'omugabe; yaamwohereza, yaagyenda n'obusingye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Yoabu yaaza ow'omugabe, yaamubuuza ati: Eki okozire ki? Abuneeri mwene okwija owaawe, okamureka akagyenda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 27:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omanyire kimwe Abuneeri mwene Neeri ku aizire kukubeihabeiha, n'okukutata ngu amanye oku ohurura n'oku otabaaruka, n'okwetegyereza ebi orikukora byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu ku yaarugire owa Daudi kutabaara, yaatuma entumwa, zaakurata Abuneeri, zaamugarurira aha iziba rya Siira; kwonka Daudi atarikukimanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.20.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 20:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.20.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abuneeri ku yaagarukire Heburooni, Yoabu yaamutwara hangahari omu irembo ahagati, ngu agambe nawe omu mubonano; ku baahikireho, yaamuteera aha nda, yaamugwisaho naamuhoorera eshagama y'omurumuna Asaheeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ku yaakihuriire, yaagira ati: Nyowe n'engoma yangye titurigiibwaho rubanja rw'eshagama ya Abuneeri mwene Neeri omu maisho ga Ruhanga okuhitsya ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 2:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 7:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kureka ruryaguma ahari Yoabu n'aha ka ya ishe; kandi eka ye teribura kubamu orikurugwamu amahira, nari omubembe, nari okugyendera aha kibango, nari ow'okwitwa rurara, nari omukuuhuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo nikwo Yoabu na Abishai baitsire Abuneeri, nibamuhoorera murumuna waabu ou yaitiire omu rugamba rwa Gibeoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.3.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
